  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Health In Harmony - Using reforestation and health care incentives to protect orangutan habitat in Indonesian Borneo Year 9: Expanding the Landscape of Orangutan Habitat</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will accomplish the following objectives: (1) Reforest illegal gardens within park boundaries, and maintain reforestation sites; (2) Development of alternative livelihoods; and (3) Further extend the reach of orangutan habitat protection by strengthening community involvement in conservation in Bukit Baka Bukit Raya National Park.</narrative>
  </description>
